# Whole-store listings exports. Kept out of the repo because this repo is public
# and the export carries CostOfGoods and InternalNote for every listing. The
# dashboard build reads it locally; the page it produces holds only aggregate
# counts, so nothing per-listing is published. Say the word if you would rather
# version it.
crosslist/store-export.csv
listings*.csv
